1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,706
It has been coming on so gradually,
that I hardly know when it began.

2
00:00:04,315 --> 00:00:05,526
Now I am quite happy

3
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:09,216
I was going to look for
you; come into my room.

4
00:00:09,472 --> 00:00:12,659
Or, in other words, you
are determined to have him.

5
00:00:13,464 --> 00:00:16,808
I am more likely to want more
time than courage, Elizabeth.

6
00:00:17,523 --> 00:00:18,661
Good gracious!

7
00:00:19,016 --> 00:00:20,700
There can be no doubt of that.

8
00:00:21,204 --> 00:00:22,457
How could you begin?

9
00:00:23,468 --> 00:00:26,233
When I went away, I felt
that it would soon happen.

10
00:00:27,378 --> 00:00:30,306
if your nephew does not object to
them, they can be nothing to you.
